      "El jurado estará integrado por:": "The jury will be composed of:",
      "Miembros de la coordinación de GenderCom.": "Members of the GenderCom coordination team.",
      "Representantes de las entidades financiadoras y colaboradoras de los Premios GenderCom 2026.": "Representatives of the funding and partner organizations of the GenderCom Awards 2026.",
      "Profesorado e investigadores/as de la Universidad de Granada.": "Faculty members and researchers from the University of Granada.",
